# Ansible Infrastructure Automation

## Day 1 - Ansible Fundamentals

### Environment
- Control Node: Local Linux VM
- Managed Nodes: AWS EC2 instances
- Communication: SSH

### Topics Practiced
- Ansible installation
- Inventory configuration
- SSH connectivity
- Ad-hoc commands
- Ansible modules
- Linux server information gathering

### Commands Practiced
- ansible --version
- ansible-inventory --list
- ansible all -m ping
- ansible all -m command -a "uptime"
- ansible all -m command -a "df -h"

### ansible Syntax : ansible all -m command -a "free -g"
### here ansible -> ansible cmd , all -> targerting hosts , -m -> module , command -> module name , -a -> argument , "free -g" -> shell command
